<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>And I would hope that You would take</l><l>This opportunity</l><l>To go as far as possible,</l><l>As possible in me.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>’Though many barriers hidden be,</l><l>You know, Lord, deep within—</l><l>Lord, I want nothing else but You,</l><l>Lord, I want no one else but You.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>So only this moment have I,</l><l>This opportunity;</l><l>This precious time I grant, dear Lord,</l><l>Solely unto You.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
